OL,3,GNEWSADemolished Victorian station
OL,4,Acanopy to be rebuilt
OL,5,
OL,6,FA heritage railway is working to
OL,7,Freinstate a Victorian-era station
OL,8,Fcanopy to complete the restoration of a
OL,9,F19th-century station.
OL,11,FThe wooden canopy over the entrance to
OL,12,FCorfe Castle Station, in Dorset, was
OL,13,Fdemolished by British Railways in the
OL,14,F1950s, before the closure of the line
OL,15,Fin 1972.
OL,17,FThe project by Swanage Railway is the
OL,18,Ffinal phase of the restoration of the
OL,19,Fgrade II listed building and will
OL,20,Freturn it to the way it looked when the
OL,21,Fline opened in 1885.
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
